{"title": "Channel Divinity: War God's Blessing", "pageid": 34233, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Channel_Divinity:_War_God's_Blessing", "categories": ["Class features", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:War_God%27s_Blessing.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/War_God%27s_Blessing.webp/300px-War_God%27s_Blessing.webp, /w/images/5/5a/War_God%27s_Blessing.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/War_God%27s_Blessing.webp/300px-War_God%27s_Blessing.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/War_God%27s_Blessing.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Channel Divinity: War God's Blessing</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Passive_feature\" title=\"Passive feature\">passive feature</a> that enables use of the reaction <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/War_God%27s_Blessing\" title=\"War God's Blessing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/25px-War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/38px-War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/50px-War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"War God's Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/25px-War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/War_God%27s_Blessing\" title=\"War God's Blessing\">War God's Blessing</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Endow a nearby ally with the glory of your god to grant them a +10 bonus to their <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/War_God%27s_Blessing\" title=\"War God's Blessing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/40px-War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/60px-War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/80px-War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"War God's Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/40px-War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/War_God%27s_Blessing\" title=\"War God's Blessing\">War God's Blessing</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Classes:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Class level 6: <a href=\"/wiki/War_Domain\" title=\"War Domain\">War Domain</a></li></ul>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adrielle\" title=\"Adrielle\">Adrielle</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bel\" title=\"Bel\">Bel</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dorikel\" title=\"Dorikel\">Dorikel</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Furek\" title=\"Furek\">Furek</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ghulen\" title=\"Ghulen\">Ghulen</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Keris\" title=\"Keris\">Keris</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Merim\" title=\"Merim\">Merim</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mola\" title=\"Mola\">Mola</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nola\" title=\"Nola\">Nola</a></li></ul>\n</div>        \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715054426\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 913/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6579/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2325/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 508/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 830004/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   33.361      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   33.361      1 -total\n 45.98%   15.341      1 Template:PageSeo\n 45.10%   15.046      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 35.23%   11.754      2 Template:SAI\n 32.30%   10.776      2 Template:Icon_link\n 31.11%   10.380      2 Template:Icon_text\n 26.92%    8.982      4 Template:Trim\n 21.55%    7.191      2 Template:Ifempty\n 10.38%    3.464      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34233-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715054426 and revision id 270471. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}